{"speciesId":390,"names":{"fr":"Ouisticram","es":"Chimchar","en":"Chimchar","ja":"ヒコザル"},"descriptions":[{"language":"en","version":"diamond","text":"It agilely scales sheer cliffs to live atop craggy mountains. Its fire is put out when it sleeps."},{"language":"en","version":"pearl","text":"Its fiery rear end is fueled by gas made in its belly. Even rain can’t extinguish the fire."},{"language":"en","version":"platinum","text":"It is very agile. Before going to sleep, it extinguishes the flame on its tail to prevent fires."},{"language":"en","version":"heartgold","text":"The gas made in its belly burns from its rear end. The fire burns weakly when it feels sick."},{"language":"en","version":"soulsilver","text":"The gas made in its belly burns from its rear end. The fire burns weakly when it feels sick."},{"language":"fr","version":"black","text":"Il est très agile. Il fait toujours attention d’éteindre la flamme de sa queue avant de se coucher."},{"language":"en","version":"black","text":"It is very agile. Before going to sleep, it extinguishes the flame on its tail to prevent fires."},{"language":"fr","version":"white","text":"Il est très agile. Il fait toujours attention d’éteindre la flamme de sa queue avant de se coucher."},{"language":"en","version":"white","text":"It is very agile. Before going to sleep, it extinguishes the flame on its tail to prevent fires."},{"language":"en","version":"black-2","text":"It is very agile. Before going to sleep, it extinguishes the flame on its tail to prevent fires."},{"language":"en","version":"white-2","text":"It is very agile. Before going to sleep, it extinguishes the flame on its tail to prevent fires."},{"language":"fr","version":"x","text":"La flamme de sa queue est alimentée par un gaz de son estomac. Même la pluie ne saurait l’éteindre."},{"language":"es","version":"x","text":"El gas de su panza alimenta el fuego de su parte trasera, que ni la lluvia puede extinguir."},{"language":"en","version":"x","text":"Its fier